    <briefdescription>
<para>A CRTP mixin class that adds reference counting to a type. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The lifetime of an object which inherits from <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_ref_counted_base" kindref="compound">RefCountedBase</ref> is managed by calls to <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a239c4ac35d6028bfacaed4018d0488faab8e7b465df7c5979dc731d06e84ce2cf" kindref="member">Release()</ref> and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_ref_counted_base_1a2b442286ce7181d7a1fafbbbd9849202" kindref="member">Retain()</ref>, which increment and decrement the object&apos;s refcount, respectively. When a <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a239c4ac35d6028bfacaed4018d0488faab8e7b465df7c5979dc731d06e84ce2cf" kindref="member">Release()</ref> call decrements the refcount to 0, the object deletes itself. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
